{"id":"164cfea6b6bdd968","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-resolvent.md","title":"Resolvent","display":"df-resolvent — Resolvent","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-resolvent","aliases":["57-df-resolvent"],"display":"df-resolvent — Resolvent","depends_on":["[[57-df-clause]]","[[57-df-literal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-resolvent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-resolvent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-resolvent — Resolvent"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"963b86b5dc15d7e3\" href=\"?note=963b86b5dc15d7e3\" title=\"57-df-clause\">57-df-clause</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f6f3fb73df6e11c\" href=\"?note=1f6f3fb73df6e11c\" title=\"57-df-literal\">57-df-literal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"Resolvent\">Resolvent</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_1,C_2\\in\\mathrm{Clause}_S\">\\(C_1,C_2\\in\\mathrm{Clause}_S\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"963b86b5dc15d7e3\" href=\"?note=963b86b5dc15d7e3\" title=\"57-df-clause\">57-df-clause</a>。在本定义的环境中固定枢轴文字 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_S\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_S\\)</span>，其互补 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline L\">\\(\\overline L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1f6f3fb73df6e11c\" href=\"?note=1f6f3fb73df6e11c\" title=\"57-df-literal\">57-df-literal</a>；要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in C_1\">\\(L\\in C_1\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline L\\in C_2\">\\(\\overline L\\in C_2\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Res}\">\\(\\mathrm{Res}\\)</span> 保留原二元接口，省略的是这个已固定的枢轴参数；改变枢轴时必须改变环境实例。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\subseteq\\mathrm{Clause}_S\">\\(N\\subseteq\\mathrm{Clause}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。闭包不固定单个枢轴，而量化全部合法互补文字；下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Res}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Res}_L\\)</span> 仅为显式带枢轴的辅助函数，原二元 Res 仍使用已固定环境中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Res}(C_1,C_2)\\coloneqq(C_1\\setminus\\{L\\})\\cup(C_2\\setminus\\{\\overline L\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Res}(C_1,C_2)\\coloneqq(C_1\\setminus\\{L\\})\\cup(C_2\\setminus\\{\\overline L\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Res}_L(C_1,C_2)\\coloneqq(C_1\\setminus\\{L\\})\\cup(C_2\\setminus\\{\\overline L\\})\\quad(L\\in C_1\\land\\overline L\\in C_2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Res}_L(C_1,C_2)\\coloneqq(C_1\\setminus\\{L\\})\\cup(C_2\\setminus\\{\\overline L\\})\\quad(L\\in C_1\\land\\overline L\\in C_2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Res}^0(N)\\coloneqq N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Res}^0(N)\\coloneqq N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Res}^{m+1}(N)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Res}^m(N)\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Res}_L(C_1,C_2):C_1,C_2\\in\\mathrm{Res}^m(N)\\land L\\in C_1\\land\\overline L\\in C_2\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Res}^{m+1}(N)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Res}^m(N)\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Res}_L(C_1,C_2):C_1,C_2\\in\\mathrm{Res}^m(N)\\land L\\in C_1\\land\\overline L\\in C_2\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Res}^*(N)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{Res}^m(N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Res}^*(N)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{Res}^m(N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对同一对子句，不同枢轴可能给出不同结果；不能把未固定枢轴的结果叫作唯一二元函数。本文件把原先隐含的枢轴变为显式环境前提，而不变更其调用参数个数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Resolvent","text":"Resolvent","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-clause","status":"resolved","id":"963b86b5dc15d7e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-clause]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-literal","status":"resolved","id":"1f6f3fb73df6e11c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-literal]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-clause","status":"resolved","id":"963b86b5dc15d7e3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C_1,C_2\\in\\mathrm{Clause}_S$，见 [[57-df-clause]]。在本定义的环境中固定枢轴文字 $L\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_S$，其互补 $\\overline L$ 见 [[57-df-literal]]；要求 $L\\in C_1$ 且 $\\overline L\\in C_2$。$\\mathrm{Res}$ 保留原二元接口，省略的是这个已固定的枢轴参数；改变枢轴时必须改变环境实例。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-literal","status":"resolved","id":"1f6f3fb73df6e11c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"